WEBVTT

01:26.680 --> 01:29.760
[Glory]

01:30.600 --> 01:32.930
[Episode 25]

01:36.400 --> 01:37.120
Is that all?

01:38.070 --> 01:40.000
I've been to several
secondhand clothing shops

01:40.000 --> 01:41.479
to gather all these items.

01:42.150 --> 01:43.410
Everything is inside.

01:44.070 --> 01:44.680
My Lord.

01:45.430 --> 01:46.710
Governor Jiang allows his soldiers

01:46.710 --> 01:47.640
to arrest innocent people,

01:47.640 --> 01:49.120
torture them for confessions
and falsely accuse them as thieves.

01:49.120 --> 01:50.759
This is absolutely intolerable!

01:50.759 --> 01:52.070
Deploying troops without authorization
and disturbing the peace

01:52.070 --> 01:52.710
is one crime.

01:52.710 --> 01:54.039
Harming the innocent and falsely accusing
honest people as thieves

01:54.039 --> 01:54.870
is another offense.

01:54.870 --> 01:56.039
The people of Linji
are now living in fear,

01:56.039 --> 01:56.680
and their lives are in turmoil,

01:56.680 --> 01:57.920
which adds to his crimes.

01:57.920 --> 01:59.039
The petition has been drafted

01:59.039 --> 02:00.440
for your review, My Lord.

02:01.950 --> 02:03.070
Alright. Dress up.

02:03.400 --> 02:04.800
Let's leave the mansion.

02:05.760 --> 02:07.560
Linji has always been peaceful,

02:07.590 --> 02:09.650
a rare prosperous place in Jiangnan.

02:10.030 --> 02:11.280
The Rong family contributes

02:11.280 --> 02:12.870
substantial tea taxes
to the court every year.

02:12.870 --> 02:14.750
Now that the Rong family has been robbed,

02:14.750 --> 02:15.680
local officials

02:15.680 --> 02:17.750
are locked in endless accusations
with the imperial Prefect.

02:17.750 --> 02:18.360
His Majesty would never

02:18.360 --> 02:19.630
easily believe just one side.

02:19.630 --> 02:21.840
The court will surely
send a new imperial envoy.

02:21.840 --> 02:22.800
We must find evidence

02:22.800 --> 02:23.870
before the new imperial envoy

02:23.870 --> 02:24.870
arrives at Linji.

02:24.910 --> 02:25.710
Otherwise...

02:26.000 --> 02:26.930
Otherwise what?

02:31.190 --> 02:33.030
Otherwise, opposing my superior

02:33.030 --> 02:34.000
means that I,

02:34.360 --> 02:35.960
your lord, will lose my head.

02:37.360 --> 02:37.910
Jun Dai,

02:38.750 --> 02:40.120
is that Kaitai Teahouse

02:40.190 --> 02:41.870
really as busy as you described?

02:41.870 --> 02:42.670
Young Master,

02:42.790 --> 02:43.910
that Kaitai Teahouse

02:43.910 --> 02:45.150
is right by the east gate.

02:45.150 --> 02:46.310
Outside its doors,
there's a constant stream of traffic

02:46.310 --> 02:47.110
day and night.

02:47.430 --> 02:48.680
All the chief managers in town

02:48.680 --> 02:50.140
like to do business there.

02:50.240 --> 02:52.440
Fine. Let's go to this Kaitai Teahouse.

02:57.870 --> 02:58.400
Let's go.

02:59.079 --> 02:59.560
My Lord,

02:59.680 --> 03:00.800
this hat doesn't match my outfit.

03:00.800 --> 03:01.710
Could I have another one?

03:01.710 --> 03:02.570
Change it then.

03:13.840 --> 03:14.680
Steward Quan,

03:14.910 --> 03:16.030
these are the finest goods

03:16.030 --> 03:17.150
in all of Linji.

03:17.310 --> 03:19.170
Not usually shown to just anyone.

03:19.190 --> 03:20.000
Take a look.

03:20.710 --> 03:21.870
This is quite nice.

03:23.710 --> 03:25.030
This. This bead.

03:27.280 --> 03:28.740
The quality is excellent.

03:29.190 --> 03:30.250
Such a bright bead.

03:31.310 --> 03:33.310
These rice-sized ones are nothing.

03:33.680 --> 03:36.280
Have you ever seen ones
the size of pigeon eggs?

03:37.470 --> 03:38.310
Have you seen them?

03:38.310 --> 03:39.750
Don't exaggerate too much.

03:39.750 --> 03:40.470
What did you say?

03:40.470 --> 03:42.530
-What did you say?
-You’ve seen them?

03:44.120 --> 03:46.190
These items are inauspicious.

03:46.750 --> 03:49.470
I'll take all the rest.

03:51.310 --> 03:52.750
Wonderful!

03:52.750 --> 03:54.240
Really? So many?

03:54.240 --> 03:54.900
Wonderful!

03:55.680 --> 03:56.560
How generous!

04:01.280 --> 04:01.910
Steward,

04:02.120 --> 04:04.030
I have some excellent goods in my shop.

04:04.030 --> 04:05.430
I'll send someone
to fetch them right away.

04:05.430 --> 04:07.240
Would you honor us by taking a look?

04:07.240 --> 04:08.590
Bring them quickly for me to see.

04:08.590 --> 04:09.520
Yes, certainly.

04:10.800 --> 04:12.280
I have more!

04:13.310 --> 04:14.150
Look at mine!

04:15.870 --> 04:16.680
Don't push!

04:17.310 --> 04:18.510
I have more items too!

04:56.240 --> 04:57.159
From Xiu Qiong?

04:57.820 --> 04:58.620
Miss Xiu Qiong

04:58.650 --> 05:00.190
was worried about the poor prison food

05:00.190 --> 05:00.950
and specially prepared this meal

05:00.950 --> 05:02.210
for you, Lady Shanbao.

05:02.240 --> 05:03.570
Miss Xiu Qiong also said

05:03.830 --> 05:06.070
Lady Yunyin made a scene
at the Rong Mansion gate

05:06.070 --> 05:07.200
and was driven away.

05:07.720 --> 05:09.580
She's been depressed ever since.

05:10.190 --> 05:11.790
Miss Yi sent a message saying

05:11.870 --> 05:13.190
Lady Yunxi and Lady Xiangling

05:13.190 --> 05:14.240
have both entered the plantation.

05:14.240 --> 05:15.070
They're urgently recruiting workers

05:15.070 --> 05:16.720
to ensure the tribute tea
is shipped on time.

05:16.720 --> 05:18.360
Please don't worry, Lady Shanbao.

05:18.360 --> 05:19.160
I understand.

05:20.070 --> 05:21.870
Good thing you left when you did.

05:22.040 --> 05:23.900
I heard you've become a clerk now.

05:25.870 --> 05:27.600
Lady Shanbao, if you hadn't
been so generous

05:27.600 --> 05:29.180
and released me from servitude,

05:29.180 --> 05:31.310
I wouldn't have my current prospects.

05:31.940 --> 05:33.680
Father just came yesterday to tell me

05:33.680 --> 05:34.800
he's been promoted to estate manager

05:34.800 --> 05:36.130
with a salary increase.

05:36.310 --> 05:36.870
My sister

05:36.870 --> 05:38.670
can now work in the tea house too.

05:38.720 --> 05:39.800
Our entire family,

05:40.040 --> 05:41.730
young and old,
relies on your care, Lady Shanbao.

05:41.730 --> 05:43.990
We'll never forget your great kindness.

05:58.870 --> 06:00.000
Let me ask you again,

06:00.040 --> 06:00.920
when will you give me

06:00.920 --> 06:02.920
the travel permit to leave the city?

06:02.950 --> 06:04.560
Don't worry. Don't worry.

06:04.560 --> 06:06.040
Things are very tense these days.

06:06.040 --> 06:06.830
Just stay here calmly

06:06.830 --> 06:07.720
and hide for a while.

06:07.720 --> 06:08.920
Bullshit!

06:09.160 --> 06:11.040
If the case drags on for a year or more,

06:11.040 --> 06:12.120
I and my brothers

06:12.120 --> 06:13.560
will be trapped here like prisoners.

06:13.560 --> 06:15.560
Even a good man would be driven mad here!

06:15.560 --> 06:17.160
I might as well kill you first

06:17.430 --> 06:18.830
and be done with it!

06:20.310 --> 06:22.630
-You...
-If you really kill me now,

06:23.750 --> 06:24.830
I guarantee you

06:24.830 --> 06:26.690
will never leave this city alive.

06:27.830 --> 06:28.310
Let go!

06:28.800 --> 06:29.560
Let go!

06:43.270 --> 06:45.310
Alright. Alright.

06:45.870 --> 06:47.200
Just be patient for now.

06:47.790 --> 06:49.120
In another month or two,

06:49.270 --> 06:51.270
I'll help you leave the city safely.

06:51.680 --> 06:53.430
By then, with treasures in hand,

06:53.430 --> 06:55.430
you'll have wealth beyond measure.

06:55.830 --> 06:56.560
That jade tea set alone

06:56.560 --> 06:57.680
in Old Madam Rong's room

06:57.680 --> 06:59.390
would keep you fed for 2 years.

07:00.000 --> 07:02.060
Small impatience ruins great plans.

07:04.240 --> 07:05.510
Can that powerful person

07:05.510 --> 07:06.710
behind you really...

07:07.310 --> 07:08.510
Cannot be discussed.

07:11.310 --> 07:11.680
Fine.

07:32.310 --> 07:32.870
Boss.

07:35.120 --> 07:36.560
I sent you to gather information,

07:36.560 --> 07:38.159
but you've been gone so long.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.040
If you're tired of living,

07:40.040 --> 07:41.440
I'll finish you right now

07:41.600 --> 07:42.930
to avoid trouble later.

07:43.190 --> 07:44.600
Boss, have mercy!

07:44.750 --> 07:45.510
We're not like

07:45.510 --> 07:47.110
that spineless Yang fellow.

07:47.120 --> 07:48.070
We've weathered

07:48.070 --> 07:48.830
many storms.

07:48.830 --> 07:51.190
These few soldiers can't scare us.

07:51.430 --> 07:51.870
Boss.

07:52.480 --> 07:52.920
Boss.

07:54.600 --> 07:55.120
Boss.

07:55.600 --> 07:57.040
We risk our heads doing business.

07:57.040 --> 07:58.070
We don't fear scars on our necks.

07:58.070 --> 07:59.600
We only fear not selling our goods.

07:59.600 --> 08:00.070
Boss.

08:00.310 --> 08:01.430
I found a big buyer.

08:01.460 --> 08:02.140
A big buyer.

08:03.750 --> 08:06.190
Selling now? Are you looking to die?

08:06.310 --> 08:06.800
Boss.

08:06.950 --> 08:07.830
I've selected

08:07.830 --> 08:09.290
only unmarked treasures,

08:09.430 --> 08:11.160
and the gold items
have already been melted down.

08:11.160 --> 08:12.510
We'll find a middleman then.

08:12.510 --> 08:13.520
I'm sure the officials

08:13.520 --> 08:15.320
can't trace anything back to us.

08:19.270 --> 08:20.130
Is it reliable?

08:22.800 --> 08:24.690
Scent pouches! Fragrant sachets!

08:22.980 --> 08:24.580
[Liufang Treasure Studio]

08:24.720 --> 08:27.190
Candied haws!

08:28.630 --> 08:31.800
Candied haws here!

08:34.960 --> 08:35.510
Go!

08:35.750 --> 08:36.809
What's happening?

08:47.870 --> 08:48.670
Lady Shanbao.

08:49.120 --> 08:50.920
My lord requests your presence.

09:05.910 --> 09:06.550
What?

09:07.440 --> 09:09.240
Lord Lu, you want to
interrogate me tonight?

09:09.240 --> 09:11.110
Yes, I'm going to interrogate you.

09:11.110 --> 09:13.630
But considering our past relationship,

09:14.320 --> 09:16.850
you can choose
your own torture instruments.

09:21.510 --> 09:22.120
Come here.

09:24.080 --> 09:24.880
Come here now.

09:47.630 --> 09:49.090
See if you recognize this.

10:02.390 --> 10:03.790
It's my family heirloom.

10:08.550 --> 10:10.550
It's just an ordinary jade pendant,

10:10.720 --> 10:12.250
commonly found in markets,

10:12.840 --> 10:14.570
with nothing special about it.

10:14.630 --> 10:15.320
People often like

10:15.320 --> 10:17.200
to wear jade pendants as earrings,

10:17.200 --> 10:18.660
but this one is different.

10:18.870 --> 10:20.080
One of my ancestors

10:20.480 --> 10:22.720
was shot in the right eye
on the battlefield.

10:22.720 --> 10:23.480
When he was buried,

10:23.480 --> 10:25.480
this jade pendant
was placed in his eye socket,

10:25.480 --> 10:26.270
in the hope he would be

10:26.270 --> 10:27.870
whole again in the next life.

10:28.080 --> 10:30.340
Later, a flash flood collapsed the tomb,

10:30.600 --> 10:31.800
and this jade pendant

10:31.960 --> 10:33.790
eventually came into
my grandmother's possession.

10:33.790 --> 10:35.390
She's kept it all these years.

10:35.390 --> 10:36.940
I couldn't possibly mistake it.

10:36.940 --> 10:38.070
If the owner says so,

10:38.150 --> 10:39.280
then it must be true.

10:40.270 --> 10:41.580
These cunning bandits

10:41.890 --> 10:43.350
took only ordinary items,

10:43.390 --> 10:45.390
thinking they could fool everyone.

10:46.510 --> 10:48.440
You caught the thieves so quickly?

10:51.480 --> 10:52.080
Listen.

10:54.090 --> 10:55.060
Injustice!

10:55.630 --> 10:58.630
The officials are wrongly
accusing innocent people!

10:58.910 --> 11:00.160
Injustice!

11:00.960 --> 11:01.720
Injustice!

11:01.840 --> 11:04.840
The officials are wrongly
accusing innocent people!

11:05.790 --> 11:06.440
My Lord.

11:09.480 --> 11:11.200
It's him! It's him!

11:11.550 --> 11:12.630
The gold and jade in that box

11:12.630 --> 11:13.760
were brought by him.

11:14.150 --> 11:15.270
The precious gems

11:15.270 --> 11:16.330
were all pried out.

11:16.870 --> 11:18.440
So you're a master thief!

11:18.550 --> 11:19.750
You've ruined me!

11:20.000 --> 11:21.080
My Lord, please see clearly.

11:21.080 --> 11:22.600
You must bring me justice!

11:24.380 --> 11:26.440
I travel far and wide doing business,

11:26.630 --> 11:29.090
collecting gold and gems
through hard work.

11:29.240 --> 11:31.840
This dishonest merchant
tried to lowball me,

11:31.910 --> 11:34.030
and when I refused,
he accused me of being a thief.

11:34.030 --> 11:34.550
You

11:34.550 --> 11:36.510
shameless bastard!

11:37.320 --> 11:38.650
My Lord, this is unjust!

11:38.910 --> 11:40.550
I'm innocent, My Lord!

11:40.960 --> 11:42.200
Continue beating him.

11:42.200 --> 11:42.600
Yes.

11:43.720 --> 11:45.980
You're killing an innocent man, My Lord!

11:52.150 --> 11:52.720
My Lord,

11:53.120 --> 11:55.850
He Cifu refuses to confess
even if it means death.

11:56.480 --> 11:57.630
My grandmother is bedridden after a stroke

11:57.630 --> 11:58.630
and cannot speak.

11:59.150 --> 12:00.480
I'm already a prisoner,

12:00.900 --> 12:02.700
so my testimony isn't credible.

12:03.120 --> 12:05.050
If you can't make the thieves talk,

12:05.630 --> 12:07.230
how will you solve this case?

12:08.720 --> 12:09.320
My Lord,

12:09.440 --> 12:11.080
these thieves are extremely cunning.

12:11.080 --> 12:12.270
They're hiding separately

12:12.270 --> 12:13.790
and can't be caught all at once.

12:13.790 --> 12:14.670
Even those two

12:15.150 --> 12:15.750
were only caught

12:15.750 --> 12:17.030
while they were trading
with the jewelry shop,

12:17.030 --> 12:18.510
when we quietly apprehended them.

12:18.510 --> 12:19.960
I fear if we delay too long,

12:19.960 --> 12:21.820
the rest of the bandits will flee.

12:23.490 --> 12:25.150
It's the first watch already.

12:29.050 --> 12:31.850
Caught red-handed
yet still refusing to confess.

12:32.120 --> 12:34.200
They must have powerful backing.

12:35.320 --> 12:37.750
Well, encountering these vicious

12:38.000 --> 12:39.260
and heinous criminals

12:39.790 --> 12:41.720
gives me a chance to show my skills.

12:42.830 --> 12:44.630
Before the third watch tonight,

12:44.630 --> 12:46.030
I will make those bandits

12:46.440 --> 12:48.570
voluntarily confess to their crimes.

12:53.790 --> 12:54.960
You said it yourself

12:56.270 --> 12:58.570
that you believe I can
distinguish right from wrong

12:58.570 --> 13:00.430
and give justice to the innocent.

13:02.960 --> 13:05.020
How could I possibly disappoint you?

13:16.360 --> 13:17.620
Then I'll wait and see.

13:23.000 --> 13:23.790
Water.

13:24.870 --> 13:27.200
I need water.

13:28.480 --> 13:30.240
I need water.

13:30.720 --> 13:33.100
What are you yelling
about in the middle of the night?

13:33.100 --> 13:34.050
Until you sign,

13:34.080 --> 13:35.670
you won't get a drop of water.

13:35.670 --> 13:37.600
Keep yelling and I'll cut out your tongue.

13:37.600 --> 13:40.120
The officials are wronging
an innocent man!

13:40.120 --> 13:41.050
Shut your mouth!

13:43.870 --> 13:46.480
Mr. Xu, give him some water.

13:46.960 --> 13:48.550
Then we'll all have some peace.

13:48.550 --> 13:50.940
So he won't make a racket
in the middle of the night.

13:50.940 --> 13:51.980
It's so annoying.

14:01.600 --> 14:02.080
You...

14:03.230 --> 14:05.490
If you want to live, don't ask questions.

14:07.000 --> 14:08.240
Hurry, put on his clothes.

14:08.240 --> 14:09.920
I'll lead you out of the city
under cover of darkness.

14:09.920 --> 14:11.150
Someone will meet you
in the west of the city.

14:11.150 --> 14:12.480
I knew Mr. Yang

14:12.720 --> 14:13.850
would keep his word.

14:14.200 --> 14:15.120
That patron of his

14:15.120 --> 14:16.200
truly has incredible

14:16.200 --> 14:16.960
influence.

14:19.000 --> 14:19.930
Where's my man?

14:21.240 --> 14:23.040
Everything's arranged. Hurry!

14:27.870 --> 14:28.870
I'll go check ahead.

14:28.870 --> 14:30.070
Don't wander around.

14:31.240 --> 14:31.770
Let's go.

14:36.080 --> 14:36.960
As if they

14:36.960 --> 14:38.150
could make me talk.

14:38.530 --> 14:40.030
I fear neither fire nor water,

14:40.030 --> 14:41.160
nor blade nor spear!

14:48.000 --> 14:48.550
This way.

15:21.630 --> 15:23.960
The two ringleaders know they are sinful.

15:24.670 --> 15:26.270
They assaulted the guards late at night

15:26.270 --> 15:27.670
and escaped from prison.

15:27.980 --> 15:30.200
They can be executed immediately
according to the law.

15:30.200 --> 15:31.530
Execute them on the spot

15:32.000 --> 15:33.790
to set the public's mind at ease.

15:33.790 --> 15:34.510
No, no, no!

15:34.630 --> 15:35.840
You haven't even tried
my case in court yet!

15:35.840 --> 15:37.250
You... You can't kill me!

15:37.550 --> 15:38.960
Before, you were a suspect,

15:38.960 --> 15:40.870
so naturally you needed to be questioned.

15:40.870 --> 15:42.720
Now you're an escaped prisoner.

15:43.120 --> 15:44.850
What's wrong with killing you?

15:45.030 --> 15:45.670
Do it.

15:50.190 --> 15:51.120
I'll talk! I'll talk!

15:51.120 --> 15:52.910
I'll confess everything!

15:53.360 --> 15:54.560
Please don't kill me!

15:58.270 --> 16:00.480
It was... It was Yang Yitang.

16:00.630 --> 16:02.150
He approached me first for the deal.

16:02.150 --> 16:03.960
He said he had powerful backing.

16:03.960 --> 16:06.280
That if we were caught by officials,
it wouldn't matter.

16:06.280 --> 16:07.560
Someone would save me.

16:09.440 --> 16:12.170
So there really is
a powerful patron behind this.

16:12.550 --> 16:13.120
However, I had already

16:13.120 --> 16:14.480
suspected all of this.

16:15.030 --> 16:16.890
No need for your redundant words.

16:16.960 --> 16:17.440
Jun Dai.

16:18.550 --> 16:19.030
I know

16:19.030 --> 16:21.170
where that Yang fellow is hiding!

16:21.200 --> 16:23.510
Please, My Lord, don't kill me!

16:26.120 --> 16:28.870
It's the third watch already.

16:39.670 --> 16:40.600
Coming, coming!

16:43.910 --> 16:44.790
Who are you people?

16:44.790 --> 16:45.390
Seize him!

16:46.320 --> 16:46.960
Everyone,

16:47.270 --> 16:48.330
what are you doing?

16:51.200 --> 16:51.860
Don't move!

16:53.960 --> 16:54.960
Search the place!

17:01.480 --> 17:03.390
Who are you people anyway?

17:03.840 --> 17:04.750
My Lord, there's no one inside.

17:04.750 --> 17:05.950
Nothing here either.

17:08.400 --> 17:09.300
The suspect climbed
over the wall and escaped.

17:09.300 --> 17:09.849
After him!

17:09.849 --> 17:10.380
Yes, sir!

17:10.569 --> 17:12.230
The fugitive is ahead! Hurry!

17:22.200 --> 17:23.800
I'll wait until five at most.

17:24.190 --> 17:25.640
Please pass on my message.

17:25.640 --> 17:27.099
If I don't see Lady Yunshu,

17:27.310 --> 17:29.240
then I'll meet her at Chongxi Hall.

17:38.720 --> 17:41.400
Lady Yunshu, Mr. Bai is...

17:44.720 --> 17:45.520
You may leave.

18:00.450 --> 18:01.800
Why have you come here?

18:03.070 --> 18:04.800
Lu Jianglai is hunting me down.

18:05.110 --> 18:07.030
You need to help me leave Linji quickly.

18:07.030 --> 18:08.760
Your patron has abandoned you,

18:09.030 --> 18:10.750
so now you come to me seeking refuge?

18:10.750 --> 18:12.240
Lady Yunshu, you're mistaken.

18:12.240 --> 18:13.840
I'm not here seeking refuge.

18:14.110 --> 18:15.840
After all, we were once allies.

18:16.070 --> 18:17.070
If I'm captured,

18:17.510 --> 18:18.110
I'm afraid you

18:18.110 --> 18:19.910
won't have a good ending either.

18:20.590 --> 18:21.920
You're threatening me?

18:22.790 --> 18:23.920
I'm just helping you see

18:23.920 --> 18:25.720
the current situation clearly.

18:28.310 --> 18:29.510
You just said

18:30.400 --> 18:32.200
Lu Jianglai is hunting you down.

18:32.640 --> 18:34.240
You escaped from him?

18:34.350 --> 18:37.000
That's right. Before he discovers me,

18:37.550 --> 18:39.280
help me leave the city quickly.

18:49.200 --> 18:50.330
I deliberately left

18:50.680 --> 18:52.280
one side of this trap net open

18:52.590 --> 18:53.270
so Yang Yitang could go

18:53.270 --> 18:54.730
where he's supposed to go.

18:55.960 --> 18:56.720
Where?

18:57.200 --> 18:59.400
I have men watching
the Provincial Governor's Office.

18:59.400 --> 19:00.090
If Jiang Yiqian

19:00.090 --> 19:01.220
is truly his patron,

19:01.500 --> 19:02.500
then he must be

19:02.520 --> 19:04.160
caught at
the Provincial Governor's Office.

19:04.160 --> 19:06.420
That would be catching them red-handed.

19:08.220 --> 19:09.170
You people

19:09.640 --> 19:10.790
are so cunning.

19:11.730 --> 19:12.340
What if he doesn't dare

19:12.340 --> 19:13.960
go to the Provincial Governor's Office?

19:13.960 --> 19:14.750
Then he must have

19:14.750 --> 19:16.200
other accomplices in the city.

19:16.200 --> 19:18.400
Catching them all would be convenient.

19:19.550 --> 19:20.750
I suspect this person

19:23.590 --> 19:24.880
might be at...

19:25.510 --> 19:26.240
Where?

19:28.400 --> 19:29.830
My Lord, that Yang fellow

19:29.830 --> 19:31.760
is heading toward the Rong family.

19:36.790 --> 19:37.400
My Lord,

19:38.470 --> 19:40.200
since the trouble is at my home,

19:40.240 --> 19:42.240
please allow me to capture them myself

19:42.240 --> 19:43.500
to prove my innocence.

19:46.070 --> 19:48.110
You're afraid I might
let the criminal escape

19:48.110 --> 19:49.510
and implicate yourself?

19:53.750 --> 19:55.210
Now that I'm useful to you,

19:55.270 --> 19:56.440
Lady Shanbao,

19:56.830 --> 19:58.630
you're finally being nice to me.

19:59.030 --> 20:00.090
I fear that someday

20:00.270 --> 20:01.750
when you clear your name,

20:02.400 --> 20:04.400
you'll throw me over the wall again.

20:05.750 --> 20:06.510
I won't.

20:08.650 --> 20:09.910
You're not lying to me?

20:13.850 --> 20:15.850
Fine, I believe you.

20:33.350 --> 20:35.790
But Lady Shanbao, don't be impatient.

20:36.640 --> 20:38.840
It's better to catch someone in the act.

20:57.640 --> 20:59.040
You've made up your mind?

20:59.640 --> 21:01.030
You used threats and inducements.

21:01.030 --> 21:02.160
How could I not come?

21:15.310 --> 21:16.370
Are you reluctant?

21:18.600 --> 21:19.550
What you're asking me to give up

21:19.550 --> 21:20.680
is wealth and status,

21:20.680 --> 21:22.960
and the noble identity
of Lady Rong Yunshu.

21:22.960 --> 21:24.270
Even if I'm reluctant,
what difference does it make?

21:24.270 --> 21:25.600
Would you let me go back?

21:27.270 --> 21:29.400
The luggage and boat have been waiting

21:30.270 --> 21:31.670
at the dock for some time.

21:39.680 --> 21:40.400
Let's go.

22:09.440 --> 22:12.070
Yunshu, don't be mad at me.

22:13.440 --> 22:15.200
After the spring examination is over,

22:15.200 --> 22:16.260
I'll bring you back

22:16.750 --> 22:18.410
to apologize to Grandmother.

22:18.490 --> 22:19.350
You're just afraid I might

22:19.350 --> 22:21.070
poison that wicked old woman.

22:21.510 --> 22:22.550
That's why you're in such a hurry

22:22.550 --> 22:23.650
to force me to leave,

22:23.650 --> 22:25.380
not even daring to say goodbye.

22:25.920 --> 22:27.680
Now that things have come to this,

22:27.680 --> 22:29.540
why still pretend to be virtuous?

22:34.550 --> 22:36.640
I know you talk tough
but have a soft heart.

22:36.640 --> 22:37.550
You certainly wouldn't do

22:37.550 --> 22:39.280
something so unconscionable.

22:40.160 --> 22:40.750
Yunshu.

22:41.920 --> 22:43.510
You've been mad at me the whole way.

22:43.510 --> 22:44.770
Have some water first.

22:59.270 --> 23:00.070
You're wrong.

23:02.480 --> 23:03.110
What?

23:07.070 --> 23:07.830
Come out.

23:28.960 --> 23:30.510
Don't move, Mr. Bai.

23:30.880 --> 23:32.790
This boat is small and the river is deep.

23:32.790 --> 23:35.070
Fall in and your body will never be found.

23:40.270 --> 23:41.670
You agreed to come with me

23:42.590 --> 23:44.030
just to help him escape?

23:48.780 --> 23:49.650
Lady Yunshu and I

23:49.650 --> 23:50.980
are on the same side.

23:51.720 --> 23:53.110
If you're smart,

23:53.440 --> 23:55.110
you should know your place.

24:03.750 --> 24:04.640
Don't you know

24:04.640 --> 24:06.040
what kind of person he is?

24:06.160 --> 24:06.880
How could you

24:06.880 --> 24:08.140
get involved with him?

24:09.160 --> 24:10.350
Did he threaten you?

24:16.750 --> 24:18.410
You're no different from him.

24:19.040 --> 24:20.640
You're both threatening me.

24:24.140 --> 24:26.690
Don't worry. Once I'm safe,

24:27.750 --> 24:29.440
I'll naturally be discreet

24:29.880 --> 24:32.610
and won't make things
difficult for Lady Yunshu.

24:48.510 --> 24:49.440
You poisoned me.

25:05.960 --> 25:08.620
I despise being threatened
more than anything.

25:09.470 --> 25:10.430
My life

25:11.400 --> 25:12.160
must remain

25:12.160 --> 25:13.350
in my own hands.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.800
Hasn't Lord Lu caught up yet?

25:34.960 --> 25:36.960
-Lady Yunshu, no sign of him.
-Fine.

25:37.200 --> 25:38.860
You dare to scheme against me.

25:39.240 --> 25:41.300
Then don't expect to get away with it.

26:25.360 --> 26:26.160
Yunshu.

26:38.030 --> 26:39.200
You'll keep it a secret,

26:39.200 --> 26:39.880
right?

26:41.160 --> 26:43.020
I'll send you back to the capital.

26:43.400 --> 26:44.830
You'll swallow

26:45.480 --> 26:47.200
what you know, okay?

26:53.030 --> 26:53.680
No.

26:55.830 --> 26:57.720
I want you to leave with me.

27:05.680 --> 27:06.400
I told you,

27:07.920 --> 27:09.920
I hate being threatened most of all.

28:11.750 --> 28:13.550
I don't know how I offended him.

28:14.130 --> 28:15.640
Last night he broke into my house

28:15.640 --> 28:17.440
and forced me to help him escape.

28:17.790 --> 28:19.720
Fortunately, I'm always cautious

28:19.860 --> 28:21.460
and carry sedatives with me,

28:21.750 --> 28:23.280
so I was able to capture him.

28:25.640 --> 28:27.770
Such a villain disrupts public order.

28:28.160 --> 28:30.560
I hope you'll punish him
properly, Lord Lu.

28:30.790 --> 28:31.390
Of course.

28:36.920 --> 28:38.250
Where is Bai Yingsheng?

28:41.510 --> 28:43.000
Bai tried to protect me

28:44.110 --> 28:46.640
but was thrown into
the water by this villain.

28:46.830 --> 28:49.030
I've been searching but found nothing.

28:49.720 --> 28:50.480
Now that I've handed the criminal over

28:50.480 --> 28:51.400
to you, Lord Lu,

28:52.030 --> 28:53.890
I'll continue searching for Bai.

29:19.790 --> 29:20.750
Get more people

29:21.480 --> 29:23.030
to search for Bai Yingsheng.

29:23.030 --> 29:23.880
Yes, My Lord.

29:29.960 --> 29:30.490
Let's go.

29:34.510 --> 29:35.270
This sister of yours

29:35.270 --> 29:36.680
is truly extraordinary.

29:37.480 --> 29:39.140
I fear she already saw through

29:39.160 --> 29:41.070
my intentional release of Yang Yitang,

29:41.070 --> 29:42.070
so she deliberately planned

29:42.070 --> 29:43.400
to hand over Yang Yitang

29:43.470 --> 29:45.200
to clear herself of suspicion.

29:45.540 --> 29:47.600
If Yang Yitang implicates her later,

29:47.830 --> 29:49.030
it will only be seen as

29:49.110 --> 29:50.640
an act of personal revenge.

29:50.750 --> 29:51.590
She managed to stay in Rong Mansion,

29:51.590 --> 29:53.790
keeping a low profile for over a decade.

29:54.030 --> 29:56.060
She's certainly no ordinary person.

29:56.060 --> 29:56.890
I won't let any of those

29:56.890 --> 29:58.750
involved in this case off easily.

29:59.680 --> 30:01.720
Bai Yingsheng's fate remains unknown.

30:01.720 --> 30:03.780
This case will not be closed hastily.

30:05.270 --> 30:06.330
Come to think of it,

30:07.640 --> 30:08.240
you two have been

30:08.240 --> 30:09.700
sisters for over a decade.

30:09.920 --> 30:11.380
If she remains obstinate,

30:12.070 --> 30:14.270
could you bear to take action yourself?

30:25.280 --> 30:26.170
[Imperial Inspector Luo Deze,
newly appointed by the Court,]

30:26.170 --> 30:27.060
[will arrive in Linji tomorrow.
All preparations are in place.]

30:28.960 --> 30:29.510
My Lord,

30:30.030 --> 30:31.310
the new Imperial Inspector
sent by the court

30:31.310 --> 30:33.040
will arrive in Linji tomorrow.

30:38.200 --> 30:39.240
Bind him first.

30:39.920 --> 30:42.250
I will interrogate him through the night.

31:07.030 --> 31:08.630
This case is no small matter.

31:08.880 --> 31:10.720
It involves the Emperor's
beloved officials.

31:10.720 --> 31:13.680
It's not something that can be easily
handled by local authorities.

31:13.680 --> 31:16.010
Please, Lord Luo, make a decisive action.

31:16.270 --> 31:17.670
Please immediately send

31:17.790 --> 31:18.960
a memorial to the imperial court,

31:18.960 --> 31:20.220
requesting judgment.

31:21.000 --> 31:21.550
My Lord.

31:23.240 --> 31:25.240
My Lord, Prefect Lu Jianglai
requests an audience.

31:25.240 --> 31:25.970
Good timing.

31:26.310 --> 31:27.310
If he hadn't come,

31:27.540 --> 31:29.870
I would have sent someone to question him.

31:30.640 --> 31:31.470
Bring him in.

31:31.990 --> 31:32.510
Yes.

31:40.270 --> 31:42.640
Lord Luo, forgive me
for not greeting you properly.

31:42.640 --> 31:44.550
My Lord, you carry
a heavy responsibility on this visit.

31:44.550 --> 31:46.070
Let's skip the pleasantries.

31:46.070 --> 31:47.240
Once the case is resolved,

31:47.240 --> 31:49.440
I will host a welcoming banquet for you.

31:49.590 --> 31:51.320
Guards, bring in the prisoner!

32:00.440 --> 32:01.240
Lord Lu!

32:02.400 --> 32:03.930
What is the meaning of this?

32:04.070 --> 32:05.270
You're conducting a trial

32:05.270 --> 32:06.860
in the Provincial Governor's Office?

32:06.860 --> 32:08.520
Lord Jiang, please calm down.

32:08.750 --> 32:09.310
Lord Luo,

32:09.880 --> 32:10.750
He Cifu is the real

32:10.750 --> 32:12.350
ringleader who robbed the Rong Mansion.

32:12.350 --> 32:13.590
The remaining 16 criminals

32:13.590 --> 32:14.920
have all been captured.

32:15.310 --> 32:16.160
He confessed that

32:16.160 --> 32:18.030
he was acting under orders
from the corrupt merchant Yang Yitang

32:18.030 --> 32:20.350
and secretly hid stolen weapons
in the tea plantation

32:20.350 --> 32:21.790
to frame Rong Shanbao.

32:22.480 --> 32:23.210
Yang Yitang,

32:23.480 --> 32:24.740
repeat what you told me

32:24.740 --> 32:26.310
to the Imperial Inspector.

32:30.750 --> 32:32.480
All the stolen goods have been found.

32:32.480 --> 32:34.220
If you don't
name the mastermind behind this,

32:34.220 --> 32:35.560
you alone will bear

32:35.590 --> 32:36.570
the serious crimes of murder, robbery,

32:36.570 --> 32:38.440
and falsely accusing the innocent.

32:38.440 --> 32:40.170
You'd better think carefully.

32:48.960 --> 32:50.160
Imperial Inspector,

32:50.640 --> 32:52.240
I don't have the guts.

32:52.350 --> 32:53.080
It was all...

32:54.110 --> 32:56.240
It was all the order of Governor Jiang.

32:56.480 --> 32:57.340
Preposterous!

32:57.720 --> 32:59.750
Do you know that falsely accusing
a government official

32:59.750 --> 33:01.480
is punishable by death by dismemberment?

33:01.480 --> 33:02.240
Heaven knows

33:02.680 --> 33:03.680
I dare not lie.

33:04.310 --> 33:05.640
Ten years ago, you arbitrarily ruled that

33:05.640 --> 33:06.790
Wei Kejian was a murderer.

33:06.790 --> 33:08.830
To quickly close the case
and quiet public opinion,

33:08.830 --> 33:09.680
you instructed Xu Song

33:09.680 --> 33:11.090
to substitute a male corpse for Madam Yang

33:11.090 --> 33:12.440
and hastily closed the case.

33:12.440 --> 33:13.680
You feared that Lu Jianglai
and Rong Shanbao

33:13.680 --> 33:14.810
would continue investigating.

33:14.810 --> 33:16.120
You also feared
those county officials in prison

33:16.120 --> 33:17.510
might overturn the verdict
and take it up the chain.

33:17.510 --> 33:19.200
Sooner or later,
it would come back to you.

33:19.200 --> 33:21.600
So you decided
to eliminate all loose ends.

33:22.030 --> 33:24.070
You keep saying I instructed you.

33:24.590 --> 33:26.050
What evidence do you have?

33:26.270 --> 33:27.790
For our regular communications,

33:27.790 --> 33:29.260
you always sent him to find me.

33:29.260 --> 33:29.920
I remember

33:29.920 --> 33:31.070
every time and place clearly.

33:31.070 --> 33:32.270
Imperial Inspector.

33:33.000 --> 33:34.590
My Lord, I have no idea

33:34.590 --> 33:36.320
what this man is talking about.

33:38.350 --> 33:40.610
Lord Luo, you heard it with your own ears.

33:41.050 --> 33:42.660
Now you understand

33:42.690 --> 33:44.690
how difficult this case is to judge.

33:44.720 --> 33:45.960
I came to Linji

33:46.350 --> 33:48.590
originally to deliver
birthday gifts to the Empress Dowager,

33:48.590 --> 33:50.920
never expecting to encounter such a case.

33:51.400 --> 33:53.000
This tea farmer, Chen Asong,

33:53.070 --> 33:56.400
has accused Rong Shanbao
of using tea cultivation as a cover

33:56.750 --> 33:59.950
to secretly forge weapons
and store thousands of armors.

34:00.070 --> 34:00.920
To be safe,

34:01.270 --> 34:03.110
I have consulted with
the Provincial Governor

34:03.110 --> 34:05.600
to immediately deploy troops
and search the mountains.

34:05.600 --> 34:06.930
My Lord, this matter...

34:10.960 --> 34:12.710
Take Rong Shanbao along.

34:16.400 --> 34:18.320
Lord Lu, please.

34:24.280 --> 34:26.070
Lord Lu, what should I do?

34:26.760 --> 34:28.280
My Lord! My Lord!

34:42.590 --> 34:44.190
Lady Shanbao isn't at the tea plantation.

34:44.190 --> 34:45.800
The officials have arrested many people.

34:45.800 --> 34:47.400
Everyone is scattered and in chaos.

34:47.400 --> 34:49.040
Thankfully, you two ladies came to help.

34:49.040 --> 34:50.179
Otherwise, when Lady Shanbao returns,

34:50.179 --> 34:52.150
I wouldn't know
how to explain this situation.

34:52.150 --> 34:53.610
We are sisters, after all.

34:53.710 --> 34:55.000
No need to be so formal.

34:55.760 --> 34:56.889
If I were in trouble,

34:57.110 --> 34:57.880
your lady

34:57.880 --> 34:59.610
wouldn't stand by idly either.

35:01.320 --> 35:03.320
Such a major incident has happened,

35:03.530 --> 35:05.360
yet Grandmother is being biased,

35:05.360 --> 35:06.800
ignoring Shanbao completely.

35:06.800 --> 35:07.280
Who knows

35:07.280 --> 35:08.590
what the Rong family

35:09.180 --> 35:10.640
will become in the future?

35:11.070 --> 35:12.270
Lady Shanbao is back!

35:27.670 --> 35:28.440
Shanbao!

35:39.230 --> 35:41.690
Shanbao, why have
the officials come again?

35:42.070 --> 35:42.710
Lord Luo,

35:43.360 --> 35:44.430
the troops inside
and outside the tea plantation

35:44.430 --> 35:45.920
have already completed their search.

35:45.920 --> 35:46.960
I fear this time

35:47.190 --> 35:48.960
someone is afraid of being investigated

35:48.960 --> 35:50.760
and deliberately wasting time.

35:50.800 --> 35:51.590
Lu Jianglai,

35:52.320 --> 35:54.840
don't think that because
you're favored by His Majesty

35:54.840 --> 35:56.770
you can disrespect your superior.

35:57.510 --> 35:59.800
As the saying goes,
a cunning rabbit has three burrows.

35:59.800 --> 36:01.320
If the Rong family has tunnels,

36:01.320 --> 36:03.360
wouldn't they have them
in the mountains too?

36:03.360 --> 36:05.290
It's better to search thoroughly.

36:05.880 --> 36:07.280
Bring the person up here.

36:18.630 --> 36:19.690
Lady Rong Shanbao,

36:19.920 --> 36:21.120
do you recognize him?

36:22.880 --> 36:23.440
Traitor!

36:23.720 --> 36:24.310
What nonsense

36:24.310 --> 36:25.470
have you been telling the officials?

36:25.470 --> 36:26.800
Lady Shanbao has been kind to you
because of your young age,

36:26.800 --> 36:28.110
taking special care of you,

36:28.110 --> 36:29.510
yet you dare to falsely accuse her?

36:29.510 --> 36:32.440
Aren't you afraid heaven's lightning
will strike you dead?

36:32.440 --> 36:34.110
Speak! Where are the weapons?

36:39.320 --> 36:41.520
They're hidden in that cave over there.

36:42.190 --> 36:43.400
Weapons?

36:44.060 --> 36:46.720
How could there
be weapons on the tea mountains?

36:50.440 --> 36:50.960
Search!

37:08.000 --> 37:09.200
Take everything out!

37:09.360 --> 37:10.000
Yes!

37:20.710 --> 37:21.400
Open it.

37:21.550 --> 37:22.030
Yes.

37:36.920 --> 37:37.670
This is aged green tea

37:37.670 --> 37:39.240
that has been stored for 5 years.

37:39.240 --> 37:40.770
Please be careful, My Lord.

37:40.920 --> 37:41.980
If it gets chipped,

37:42.320 --> 37:43.630
it won't sell for much.

37:44.440 --> 37:46.150
Open them! Open all of them!

38:03.710 --> 38:04.230
My Lord.

38:04.440 --> 38:05.170
Zhang Zhong,

38:05.480 --> 38:07.140
what exactly is going on here?

38:07.920 --> 38:09.960
Where are the weapons you mentioned?

38:09.960 --> 38:11.480
My Lord, this isn't right!

38:11.770 --> 38:12.960
There must be weapons here!

38:12.960 --> 38:13.800
This isn't right!

38:13.800 --> 38:15.460
Quickly! Search everywhere!

38:15.510 --> 38:16.070
My Lord.

38:19.190 --> 38:20.250
Lady Rong Shanbao.

38:21.550 --> 38:22.110
Please.

38:32.630 --> 38:33.550
My Lord, spare me!

38:33.550 --> 38:35.000
The Provincial Governor said

38:35.000 --> 38:37.150
there must be weapons
hidden in the tea mountains

38:37.150 --> 38:38.710
and that Lady Shanbao
was planning a rebellion.

38:38.710 --> 38:39.970
If I couldn't confess,

38:40.030 --> 38:41.430
he would beat me to death.

38:41.860 --> 38:43.210
I've never heard anything

38:43.210 --> 38:44.790
about privately making weapons

38:44.790 --> 38:46.180
or raising troops.

38:46.690 --> 38:47.810
To save my life,

38:47.980 --> 38:48.760
I randomly pointed to

38:48.760 --> 38:50.520
a cellar used for making tea bricks.

38:50.520 --> 38:52.030
I just wanted to stay alive.

38:52.030 --> 38:53.330
Please don't kill me, My Lord.

38:53.330 --> 38:54.370
Don't kill me.

38:57.280 --> 38:58.400
I only asked you to interrogate,

38:58.400 --> 38:59.550
yet you used threats and bribes

38:59.550 --> 39:00.590
to fabricate evidence.

39:00.590 --> 39:01.650
You deserve to die!

39:08.710 --> 39:09.480
Lord Luo.

39:11.030 --> 39:12.890
Times have been hard these years.

39:13.220 --> 39:15.320
The border regions
have suffered either natural disasters

39:15.320 --> 39:16.720
or man-made calamities.

39:17.140 --> 39:18.580
Whenever war breaks out,

39:19.410 --> 39:20.550
the court urgently needs to transport

39:20.550 --> 39:22.320
large quantities of provisions.

39:22.320 --> 39:24.150
Others fear the dangers of war,

39:24.480 --> 39:25.650
the long journeys and low profits,

39:25.650 --> 39:27.050
avoiding it at all costs.

39:27.330 --> 39:30.110
Only the Rong family
has wholeheartedly organized

39:30.110 --> 39:32.640
and risked dangers
to transport provisions.

39:32.710 --> 39:34.110
In just these 20 years,

39:34.920 --> 39:36.220
the rice and grain
transported by our family

39:36.220 --> 39:37.880
has exceeded a million loads.

39:37.880 --> 39:39.920
The court still owes my family

39:39.920 --> 39:41.120
for transportation.

39:41.390 --> 39:44.100
Three years ago, the northern border
suffered a severe drought.

39:44.100 --> 39:46.210
The court wanted to show benevolence
to pacify the people,

39:46.210 --> 39:47.580
urging so urgently

39:47.760 --> 39:50.150
that cotton and grain
couldn't be gathered in time.

39:50.150 --> 39:51.450
Again it was the Rong family

39:51.450 --> 39:53.760
who managed to rush
supplies from the south.

39:53.760 --> 39:56.070
The Empress Dowager praised
our family's loyalty and courage,

39:56.070 --> 39:57.870
calling us pillars of the state.

40:02.400 --> 40:04.110
Lord Jiang instigated bandits

40:04.110 --> 40:05.510
to plunder the Rong family.

40:05.510 --> 40:07.280
When he failed to frame Lady Rong Shanbao,

40:07.280 --> 40:08.540
he fabricated charges

40:08.630 --> 40:10.630
and accused the Rong family of rebellion.

40:10.630 --> 40:12.190
He's acting out of personal grudges,

40:12.190 --> 40:13.320
framing the innocent.

40:13.320 --> 40:15.550
misleading official business
and harming good people,

40:15.550 --> 40:18.340
How dare he shamelessly remain
in a position of such power?

40:18.340 --> 40:20.740
Lord Luo, according to our dynasty's laws,

40:20.960 --> 40:22.450
those who falsely accuse
10 or more persons

40:22.450 --> 40:24.670
shall suffer death by dismemberment, with
their head displayed in their hometown.

40:24.670 --> 40:25.960
Lord Jiang has falsely accused

40:25.960 --> 40:27.320
the entire Rong family.

40:28.110 --> 40:30.510
Lord Luo, I hope you
will report to the court

40:30.760 --> 40:32.560
and request severe punishment.

40:34.440 --> 40:35.170
Ridiculous.

40:36.190 --> 40:38.850
I came to investigate
after receiving reports.

40:39.070 --> 40:40.150
How is it that when I arrive here

40:40.150 --> 40:41.950
it becomes my false accusation?

40:42.030 --> 40:44.560
The captured bandits
are heinous criminals.

40:44.600 --> 40:46.560
They're smearing my reputation.

40:46.730 --> 40:48.130
How can you believe them?

40:48.190 --> 40:49.550
The tea farmers on these tea mountains

40:49.550 --> 40:50.550
number 1,200.

40:51.110 --> 40:53.840
Everyone is fabricating accusations
against you, Lord Jiang.

40:53.840 --> 40:54.880
Lord Jiang, you truly

40:54.880 --> 40:56.680
have lost the people's support.

40:58.380 --> 40:59.760
The tea farmers on these mountains

40:59.760 --> 41:01.630
are all your Rong family's people,

41:01.630 --> 41:03.360
so of course they speak for you.

41:03.590 --> 41:06.410
Since taking office,
I have been upright and honest,

41:06.410 --> 41:08.380
never forming factions or cliques.

41:08.380 --> 41:09.240
The Rong family

41:09.360 --> 41:10.960
has absolute power in Linji.

41:11.070 --> 41:12.380
Now you've brought Lu Jianglai

41:12.380 --> 41:13.310
under your wing.

41:13.710 --> 41:15.190
You're afraid that I, as Governor,

41:15.190 --> 41:16.960
will block your money-making schemes.

41:16.960 --> 41:18.550
So you've joined forces

41:19.040 --> 41:20.270
to get rid of me.

41:24.920 --> 41:25.710
Take a look

41:26.190 --> 41:26.960
at this.

41:29.710 --> 41:30.970
An heirloom jade seal.

41:37.270 --> 41:39.360
Lord Jiang, to cover up his own mistakes,

41:39.360 --> 41:41.890
falsely accused my family
of making weapons.

41:41.900 --> 41:43.560
What are his true intentions?

41:44.030 --> 41:44.980
Or do you think

41:45.320 --> 41:47.180
by sacrificing a minor official,

41:47.190 --> 41:48.360
you can shift the blame

41:48.360 --> 41:49.820
and wash your hands clean?

41:51.110 --> 41:51.800
Lord Luo,

41:52.550 --> 41:54.150
are you just going to stand by

41:54.510 --> 41:56.440
while loyal subjects are wronged?

42:09.400 --> 42:10.150
Rise.

42:23.000 --> 42:25.070
I represent the Emperor
on this inspection.

42:25.070 --> 42:26.000
I never expected

42:27.280 --> 42:30.230
to encounter such
a serious case of false accusation.

42:30.230 --> 42:31.440
The truth is clear to all.

42:31.440 --> 42:33.170
I must thoroughly investigate

42:33.280 --> 42:35.140
and question those responsible.

42:35.230 --> 42:36.840
Please rest assured.

42:37.590 --> 42:39.590
I will never

42:39.920 --> 42:41.380
wrong an innocent family.

42:42.840 --> 42:44.700
Justice will not be compromised.

42:45.840 --> 42:47.100
Lord Luo, you're wise.

42:48.570 --> 42:51.430
I hope you'll examine
this case carefully, My Lord.

45:30.500 --> 45:32.790
[Tea Brick]

45:34.440 --> 45:35.230
This is aged green tea

45:35.230 --> 45:36.760
that has been stored for 5 years.

45:36.760 --> 45:38.290
Please be careful, My Lord.

45:38.510 --> 45:39.570
If it gets chipped,

45:39.920 --> 45:41.230
it won't sell for much.

45:42.080 --> 45:46.140
[Tea brick;
Dense structure; Improves with age]

45:42.440 --> 45:43.030
Why did ancient people

45:43.030 --> 45:44.830
make tea leaves into tea bricks?

45:45.280 --> 45:46.080
Just imagine.

45:46.670 --> 45:48.030
In ancient times,
there were no refrigerators

45:48.030 --> 45:49.150
or express delivery services.

45:49.150 --> 45:50.960
If tea leaves weren't properly stored,

45:50.960 --> 45:52.360
they would easily spoil.

45:52.440 --> 45:54.070
And tea leaves are very fluffy,

45:54.070 --> 45:56.280
taking up a lot of space during transport.

45:56.280 --> 45:57.280
So clever ancient people

45:57.280 --> 45:58.610
came up with a solution.

45:58.670 --> 46:00.000
They steamed the tea leaves until soft,

46:00.000 --> 46:01.150
then used molds

46:01.150 --> 46:02.610
to press them into blocks.

46:02.630 --> 46:03.980
Just like making cookies.

46:03.980 --> 46:05.320
This made them easier to preserve

46:05.320 --> 46:06.720
and convenient to carry.

46:06.800 --> 46:08.190
Tea bricks were first used
in the imperial court

46:08.190 --> 46:09.480
and by the nobility.

46:09.970 --> 46:12.100
Then they spread to frontier regions.

46:12.230 --> 46:13.150
They became treasures

46:13.150 --> 46:14.480
that nomads couldn't live without.

46:14.480 --> 46:16.760
They would carry tea bricks
while riding on horseback,

46:16.760 --> 46:17.960
brewing a cup whenever they wished—

46:17.960 --> 46:21.040
not only to quench their thirst,
but also to aid digestion.

46:21.040 --> 46:22.680
The production process of tea bricks

46:22.680 --> 46:24.600
preserves active ingredients

46:24.630 --> 46:26.590
while creating a compact structure.

46:26.590 --> 46:27.390
This achieved

46:27.480 --> 46:30.150
the legendary quality
of improving with age.
